 * Read the head branch out of `gh pr view --json headRefName,isCrossRepository`.
 *
 * Pure, and forgiving on purpose: this is one of the ways the run may end up with
 * no branch, and an answer that cannot be parsed is that case rather than an
 * exception. The fork flag is carried separately from the name because the two
 * refusals are different facts about the pull request, and a reader of the log
 * needs to be able to tell them apart.
 */
